        ["Is endoscopy safe at 75 or 80?", "Yes, for most people. Age alone is not a reason to avoid it. Heart, lung and kidney health are checked first, and sedation is adjusted."],
        ["Can I take painkillers for knee pain every day?", "Regular use of painkillers such as ibuprofen or diclofenac can cause ulcers and bleeding. Ask your doctor about safer options and whether you need stomach protection."],
